# Evaluation corpus: PDFs are re-fetchable from the pinned ids in
# eval/corpus/papers.txt and verified against manifest.json's sha256, so there
# is no reason to carry 200MB of them in git. The derived artifacts (manifest,
# chunks, queries) ARE committed — CI must never hit the network.
eval/corpus/_pdf_cache/
eval/corpus/_llm_query_cache.json
